WEBVTT

00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:02.250
Is this vendor still approved?

00:00:02.520 --> 00:00:03.930
Is their insurance current?

00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:08.890
With ICC Vendors, you can check both
before a contractor starts work.

00:00:08.933 --> 00:00:12.933
Start in the vendor register to see
qualification status and when each

00:00:12.933 --> 00:00:14.383
vendor is due for review.

00:00:14.733 --> 00:00:16.523
Open the maintenance vendor's record.

00:00:16.753 --> 00:00:20.163
The insurance certificate and its expiry
date are right there.

00:00:20.453 --> 00:00:24.473
In evaluation history, see when the vendor
was last reviewed and what the

00:00:24.473 --> 00:00:29.873
team decided. Approval, documents, and
past evaluations stay with the same

00:00:29.873 --> 00:00:34.003
vendor record so your team can make the
call without digging through files.

00:00:34.253 --> 00:00:38.113
Book a vendors demo with ISO Certification
Consultants.
